  * Custom-vocabulary verifier (CTC head): nvidia/parakeet-tdt_ctc-110m
    https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt_ctc-110m

The conversion recipe from NVIDIA's checkpoints to Core AI bundles follows
